<title>USA: Novo Nordisk wins patent dispute.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk wins patent dispute.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novo Nordis A/S said Friday that the US Court of Appeals has vacated the preliminary injunction that has been granted against Novo under a Genentech Inc patent.</p>
<p>The company said that the court has also told a district court to dismiss Genentech's calim for patent infringment under the grounds that the patent was invalid.</p>
<p>The decision, said the company, confirmed a recent cout ruling that allowed it to begin sales of its drug, Norditropin, on Feb 20.</p>
